-- Baseline schema for Tikkа platform
-- Generated by: npm run db:check-drift -- --update-baseline
-- 
-- This file represents the expected schema after running ALL committed
-- migrations (backend, indexer, oracle) against a fresh PostgreSQL instance.
--
-- IMPORTANT: Update this file whenever a schema-changing migration is merged.
--   1. Merge the migration PR
--   2. Run: npm run db:check-drift -- --update-baseline
--   3. Commit the updated baseline-schema.sql
--
-- CI will reject PRs that cause drift between this baseline and a fresh
-- migration run. If CI fails with a drift error on a migration PR, run the
-- update command above and push the baseline change as part of your PR.
